1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,800
The morning ferry leaves Piraeus at seven.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,900
<i>Kalimera.</i> Two tickets to Naxos, please.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,500
Deck or cabin?
- Deck. We want the sea air.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:10,600
Twenty-four euros each, cash or card, and the boat is running about twenty minutes late today.

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,200
{\an8}PIRAEUS PORT · GATE E7

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,400
Look, the dolphins are following the wake behind the stern again this morning.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
By noon the islands rise out of the haze,
one blue ridge after another.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,300
<b>Paros</b> first, then Naxos.

9
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:31,000
We'll find a room near the Portara
and watch the sun go down from the temple door.

10
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:34,000
<i>The ferry horn sounds.</i>
